@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}


### 0. 로그인 (먼저 실행)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@shoplab.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 1. 상품 id 확인용 (로그인 불필요)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?size=20

### 2. 담기 (1번 응답에서 판매 중인 상품 id) → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### 3. 같은 상품 또 담기 → 새 줄이 아니라 수량 2 → 5로 합쳐짐
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 3 }

### 4. 장바구니 조회 → 합계 확인
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 개수
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 수량 변경 (4번 응답의 장바구니 항목 id) → 1개로
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1 }

### 7. 품절 상품(다크 초콜릿 id) 담기 → 400 PRODUCT_NOT_ON_SALE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 16, "quantity": 1 }

### 8. 재고 초과 (게이밍 노트북 16, 재고 5개) → 400 OUT_OF_STOCK
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 9, "quantity": 6 }

### 9. 수량 0 → 400 INVALID_INPUT
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 0 }

### 10. 없는 항목 수정 → 404 CART_ITEM_NOT_FOUND
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1 }

### 11. 토큰 없이 → 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart

### 12. 하나 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 선택 삭제 (여러 개 담은 뒤 id를 쉼표로)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items?ids=1,2,3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}